    ],
    layerNote: "To use Constant instead of Proximity, make the parameter a Bool, make two states with a blush 0 clip and a blush 100 clip, and transition between them on <code>HeadPat</code> true and false. Set Transition Duration to about 0.3 and the blush fades in slowly.",
    testLabel: "4. Connect it and test",
    test: [
