      "Press Play in Unity, make an empty GameObject in the Hierarchy, add a <code>VRC Contact Sender</code> to it, and put <code>Hand</code> in its <code>Collision Tags</code>. Move it close to your head in the Scene view and check whether the <code>HeadPat</code> value changes under Parameters in the Animator window.",
      "Testing in Unity can behave differently depending on your tools and versions. The most reliable test is to upload and ask a friend to pat your head. You can also check Allow Self for a while and test with your own hand (uncheck it again afterward).",
