    physboneTitle: "PhysBone parameters (reacting when grabbed)",
    physbone: [
      `<code>VRC Phys Bone</code>, which makes hair and tails sway, can also pass values to the Animator. Type a name (e.g. <code>Tail</code>) in <code>Parameter</code> under the PhysBone's <code>Options</code>, and you can use the following parameters (${ext(links.physbones, "VRChat's PhysBones page")}).`,
