      ["Tail_Angle", "Float", "0 to 1. How far it has bent from its original direction. 1 when it points the opposite way (180°)"],
      ["Tail_Stretch", "Float", "0 to 1. How far it has stretched. 1 at its longest (Max Stretch)"],
